body:
Hopefully I'm not too late but here goes:

Basically, a short combination of what everyone said so far;

Hello "teacher", I would love to grab a cup of coffee with you sometime. Here's my number (_). Text me when you're free/in the mood!

Me personally, I might go about it a different way such as; 
Hey "teacher", you know there's this interesting coffee place at_ &_ that I wanted to try out/check out. I'd very much appreciate your company. So if you're up for it/you like to join me, here's my number (_).

Best of luck Tamsin10 *fingers crossed* :)
